@startuml Deployment
title Deployment / Components
node "Spring Boot Host" {
  component "CRAI Simulation API\n(Spring Boot)" as Api
  component "Camera Queue\n(BoundedPriorityBlockingQueue)" as CamQ
  component "Police Queue\n(LinkedBlockingQueue)" as PolQ
}

node "External Node" {
  component "Node-RED\n(webhook)" as NR
}

Api --> CamQ
Api --> PolQ
Api --> NR : HTTP webhook /alerts
actor Operator
Operator --> Api : REST (start/stop/send vehicle/status)
actor Police
Police --> Api : Get alerts
Api --> Police : Alerts
@enduml
